  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCHOLARSHIPS AND INSTITUTIONAL CAPACITY BUILDING AT IPRC KITABI: DEVELOPING TRANSBOUNDARY CAPCITY FOR BIODIVERSITY CONSERVATION WITH FOCUS ON RWANDA AND DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds under this award are to be used for (1) providing scholarships for selected protected area staff to earn diplomas in wildlife management and return to work in their home national parks; and (2) developing and incorporating new teaching materials into Kitabi Colleges curriculum on emerging threats to wildlife and trans-boundary park management.</narrative>
  </description>
